@host = http://localhost:5119
@apiKey = gh_agent_key_0001

### Chat (non-streaming) — Grounded response with RAG
# Before Demo 3, this same prompt returned generic VPN troubleshooting advice.
# Now the response references specific Globomatics procedures (GloboConnect, SSO, MFA, etc.)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "My VPN keeps timing out after MFA approval. What should I check first?"
}

### Chat (streaming SSE) — Grounded streaming response
# The streaming endpoint now also retrieves knowledge base articles before generating.
# Tokens still arrive incrementally, but the content references real Globomatics procedures.
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "My VPN keeps timing out after MFA approval. What should I check first?"
}

### Chat — Another grounded example
# Without RAG, the model would give generic advice about laptop requests.
# With RAG, it references the Globomatics equipment request process.
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "What is the process for requesting a new laptop?"
}

### Chat (streaming) — Email sync issue
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "I can't get my email to sync on my phone. What should I try?"
}
